{"type":"message","id":"b17c05e5","parentId":"bcbc6e69","timestamp":"2026-03-12T13:50:12.773Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:f6b9edc7-5375-4a0a-b88b-3989ad8ab3eb skill-evolution-hourly] 执行自动进化任务：1. 搜索 ClawHub 上最新的高效技能（搜索关键词：calendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation）；2. 筛选下载量>100且6个月内更新的技能；3. 安装有价值的技能；4. 生成简短报告记录到 memory/evolution-YYYY-MM-DD.md\nCurrent time: Thursday, March 12th, 2026 — 9:50 PM (Asia/Shanghai)\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1773323412772}}
{"type":"message","id":"4ff009d3","parentId":"b17c05e5","timestamp":"2026-03-12T13:50:23.199Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"这是一个定时任务（cron），要求我执行自动进化任务：\n1. 搜索 ClawHub 上最新的高效技能（关键词：calendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation）\n2. 筛选下载量>100且6个月内更新的技能\n3. 安装有价值的技能\n4. 生成简短报告记录到 memory/evolution-YYYY-MM-DD.md\n\n首先，我需要查看是否有相关的技能指南。从可用技能列表中，我看到有一个 \"clawhub\" 技能：\n- clawhub: Use the ClawHub CLI to search, install, update, and publish agent skills from clawhub.com\n\n这正好匹配我需要执行的任务。我应该先读取这个技能文件。\n\n根据技能系统的要求，我应该先读取最相关的技能的 SKILL.md 文件。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我来执行自动进化任务。首先加载 ClawHub 技能指南。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c42a23b6199146ad9fa1bcfd","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/opt/homebrew/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/clawhub/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":12065,"output":213,"cacheRead":3392,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15670,"cost":{"input":0.012065,"output":0.0006816000000000001,"cacheRead":0.0006784,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.013425}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773323412773}}
{"type":"message","id":"2ad93f5f","parentId":"4ff009d3","timestamp":"2026-03-12T13:50:23.205Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_c42a23b6199146ad9fa1bcfd","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: clawhub\ndescription: Use the ClawHub CLI to search, install, update, and publish agent skills from clawhub.com. Use when you need to fetch new skills on the fly, sync installed skills to latest or a specific version, or publish new/updated skill folders with the npm-installed clawhub CLI.\nmetadata:\n  {\n    \"openclaw\":\n      {\n        \"requires\": { \"bins\": [\"clawhub\"] },\n        \"install\":\n          [\n            {\n              \"id\": \"node\",\n              \"kind\": \"node\",\n              \"package\": \"clawhub\",\n              \"bins\": [\"clawhub\"],\n              \"label\": \"Install ClawHub CLI (npm)\",\n            },\n          ],\n      },\n  }\n---\n\n# ClawHub CLI\n\nInstall\n\n```bash\nnpm i -g clawhub\n```\n\nAuth (publish)\n\n```bash\nclawhub login\nclawhub whoami\n```\n\nSearch\n\n```bash\nclawhub search \"postgres backups\"\n```\n\nInstall\n\n```bash\nclawhub install my-skill\nclawhub install my-skill --version 1.2.3\n```\n\nUpdate (hash-based match + upgrade)\n\n```bash\nclawhub update my-skill\nclawhub update my-skill --version 1.2.3\nclawhub update --all\nclawhub update my-skill --force\nclawhub update --all --no-input --force\n```\n\nList\n\n```bash\nclawhub list\n```\n\nPublish\n\n```bash\nclawhub publish ./my-skill --slug my-skill --name \"My Skill\" --version 1.2.0 --changelog \"Fixes + docs\"\n```\n\nNotes\n\n- Default registry: https://clawhub.com (override with CLAWHUB_REGISTRY or --registry)\n- Default workdir: cwd (falls back to OpenClaw workspace); install dir: ./skills (override with --workdir / --dir / CLAWHUB_WORKDIR)\n- Update command hashes local files, resolves matching version, and upgrades to latest unless --version is set\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773323423204}}
{"type":"message","id":"1a93dad5","parentId":"2ad93f5f","timestamp":"2026-03-12T13:50:31.390Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，我了解了如何使用 ClawHub CLI。现在我需要：\n1. 使用 `clawhub search` 搜索关键词相关的技能\n2. 分析结果，筛选出下载量>100且6个月内更新的技能\n3. 使用 `clawhub install` 安装有价值的技能\n4. 生成报告到 memory/evolution-2026-03-12.md\n\n让我开始搜索。关键词包括：calendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation\n\n我可以一次搜索多个关键词，或者分别搜索。让我先尝试搜索几个主要的关键词。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_edf5846423f84dfe92fdf379","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search calendar"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_de38ff27ceca4728ad030a3e","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search task"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_3e5bb0825d124cb59336cdb7","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search document"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_816f3df46b334624b37ba8a4","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search meeting"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_2f2c9f3a65b94ffda22a2f17","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search email"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_39e4182081564b36a9ce24ff","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search notes"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_922d2c105bc54c648e96d08c","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search productivity"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7262742fc14041109f8ca05b","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search automation"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":692,"output":226,"cacheRead":15424,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16342,"cost":{"input":0.000692,"output":0.0007232,"cacheRead":0.0030848000000000004,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0045000000000000005}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773323423206}}
